  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed as a suru-verb: {味見|あじみ}する (to taste)\n\nPATTERNS:\n- Xの{味見|あじみ}をする (to taste X)\n- {味見|あじみ}してみる (to try tasting)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {試食|ししょく} (food sample at a store)\n- {試飲|しいん} (drink tasting)\n- {味|あじ}をみる (to check the taste)\n\nNOTE:\n{味見|あじみ} typically refers to tasting during cooking, while {試食|ししょく} refers to free samples at stores.",
